        <briefdescription>
<para>Evaluate quality of a compiled prompt template. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The template is rendered against an empty <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1a3c605b72d8b0688e6c855ef6e745a247" kindref="member">PromptContext</ref></computeroutput>; slots that are not filled are treated as empty strings. Rendering errors are captured as structural failures rather than propagated as exceptions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>tmpl</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Template to evaluate. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Quality configuration. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Aggregated <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_quality_report" kindref="compound">QualityReport</ref></computeroutput>; no internal state is retained. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
